{"id":"urm0fqgc9hlbd6nxwmkxd4s7u","title":"Manus 成为 Godot 项目的白金赞助商","originalTitle":null,"summary":"AI 公司 Manus 成为开源游戏引擎 Godot 的白金赞助商，每年至少赞助 5 万欧元。Manus 联合创始人表示，优秀的游戏源于独特的创意和体验打磨，而 Godot 通过社区共同塑造和持续发展，降低了游戏制作的技术门槛。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot"},"links":{"original":"https://www.solidot.org/story?sid=85922"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T12:32:32.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T13:53:38.791Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T13:53:38.791Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":25,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"0ac6d711-2176-443a-a159-5bc7a34c30e6","title":"AI公司Manus成为开源游戏引擎Godot白金赞助商"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"0ac6d711-2176-443a-a159-5bc7a34c30e6","title":"AI公司Manus成为开源游戏引擎Godot白金赞助商"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"froiWa-nnKp0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}